# Card rail / carousel counts

Horizontal card rails use `data-card-count="N"` on `.trim-card-rail` or `.trim-process--five`.

## Desktop (≥1024px)

- **2 cards** → static 2-column grid. No peek / drag.
- **3 cards** → static 3-column grid. No peek / drag.
- **4+ cards** → horizontal drag carousel.

## Mobile

Always allow horizontal scroll / peek, including when `data-card-count="3"`.

## Markup

Always set an accurate `data-card-count` from the rendered item length:

```html
<ul class="trim-card-rail" data-drag-scroll data-card-count="{{ items.length }}">
```
